# B&B optimization example for option-order.
# Each independent vertex lists its expensive option first. Unary ordering
# finds the zero-cost assignment on the first leaf.
# Run from the repository root.
# Enabled:  ./build-clang-modules/pbqp --solve=bnb -Werror -O0 --numthreads=1 --timeout=0.7 -foption-order examples/pbqp/individual/bnb-option-order.pbqp
# Baseline: ./build-clang-modules/pbqp --solve=bnb -Werror -O0 --numthreads=1 --timeout=0.7 -fno-option-order examples/pbqp/individual/bnb-option-order.pbqp
# Observed with Clang 21 Release on Intel Core Ultra X7 358H.
# Median elapsed CLI time over five alternating runs, including startup.
# Enabled: 7.7 ms, 5/5 optimal, COST 0.
# Baseline: 40.3 ms, 5/5 optimal, COST 0.

